<QF id="PMS Investments Foundation_12" sectionNumber="" articleNumber="0" articleName="">
    <question>
        <text><![CDATA[CAPM expresses expected return as:]]></text>
        <answers>
            <answer correct="no"><text><![CDATA[E(R) = Rf + Rm]]></text></answer>
            <answer correct="yes"><text><![CDATA[E(R) = Rf + beta*(Rm - Rf)]]></text></answer>
            <answer correct="no"><text><![CDATA[E(R) = Rm - beta]]></text></answer>
            <answer correct="no"><text><![CDATA[E(R) = Rf * beta]]></text></answer>
        </answers>
        <explanation><text><![CDATA[**The Logic:** CAPM: E(R) = Rf + beta*(market premium).
**The Trap:** Other formulas are incorrect.
**Cross-Exam Context:** Same in XV, X-A.
**Distributor's Pro-Tip:** Refresh beta and ERP assumptions annually for cost-of-equity calcs.]]></text></explanation>
    </question>
</QF>
